<div class="pg-fsps" id="pg-fsps">
  <section class="pg-fsps-sec pg-fsps-hero">
    <div class="pg-fsps-split">
      <div>
        <span class="pg-fsps-eye">Your childhood, upgraded</span>
        <h2>The Flip-Top Classic, <span>Rebuilt for Today.</span></h2>
        <p class="pg-fsps-lead">Snapping it shut mid-level when dinner was called. The click of that hinge. A whole world that fit in a jeans pocket. It is all back, with <b>5,000+ games across 30+ classic systems</b>, ready the moment you flip it open, and a mini HDMI port that puts every one of them on the&nbsp;TV.</p>
        <p class="pg-fsps-mem">The games you remember. The feeling you forgot.</p>
      </div>
      {%- if hero_img != blank -%}
      <div class="pg-fsps-photo">
        <img src="{{ hero_img | image_url: width: 900 }}" srcset="{{ hero_img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ hero_img | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 520px" alt="{{ hero_img.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="1125">
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
