        <p class="pg-fsps-lead">Then you track down the cartridges, one at a time. The Flip SP shows up with the library already on&nbsp;it.</p>
        <div class="pg-fsps-math">
          <div><small data-fsps-cmp="veye">Vintage handheld</small><strong data-fsps-cmp="vprice" data-fsps-vmax="{{ section.settings.gba_price_max | default: 190 }}">~${{ section.settings.gba_price }}</strong><em><span data-fsps-cmp="vline1">Used, one system</span><br><span data-fsps-cmp="vline2">No games</span></em></div>
